#. Description of the plugin
#: address-autocomplete-for-gravity-forms.php
msgid ""
"Modern Google Places address autocomplete for Gravity Forms. Includes a "
"single-line Address field, native Address autofill, country and language "
"controls, location bias, required suggestion selection, and entry map links. "
"Requires Gravity Forms and your own Google API key."
